              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 bg-fable-light dark:bg-ink-darker border-2 border-sage/40 rounded-xl space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs">
                <span class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">Aceleração do Ciclo de Entrega (Lead Time):</span>
